===Noun===
{{cmn-noun|s|pin=chéngyǔ|pint=cheng2yu3|tra=成語|sim=成语|mw=[[句]]/[[个]]/[[条]]/[[本]]|rs=戈03}}

# [[chengyu|Chengyu]], a certain kind of Chinese [[set phrase]] originating in [[Classical Chinese]], typically four or five [[character]]s in length.
#: [[我]][[最]][[喜欢]][[的]][[成语]][[是]]“[[画蛇添足]]”。
#: wò zuì xǐhuān de chéngyǔ shì huàshétiānzú
#:: ''My favourite '''chengyu''' is [[huàshétiānzú]].''
# Any [[idiomatic]] [[expression]].

====Usage notes====
* Although often translated as ''[[idiom]]'', in fact [[成语]] chéngyǔ refers to a specific kind of idiomatic expression in Chinese (see [[w:Chengyu|Chengyu]]). Other kinds of [[idiom]] types include [[俗语]] súyǔ, [[谚语]] yànyǔ and [[歇后语]] xiēhòuyǔ.

